Package: argon-oneup-plasma-widget
Version: 1.1.4
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: plasma-desktop
Recommends: argon-power-profiles (>= 1.1.0), argon-oneup-battery (>= 1.1.0)
Description: Argon ONE UP Dashboard Plasmoid for KDE Plasma 6
 A custom, sleek desktop dashboard widget designed specifically for the
 Argon ONE UP laptop running KDE Plasma. Provides real-time hardware telemetry:
 per-core CPU clock, SoC temperature, CW2217 battery statistics (wattage, voltage,
 health, cycle count), NVMe SSD temp, PWM fan state, and one-click power profile switching.
 Uses a compiled Cortex-A76 telemetry probe (0.4ms) with zero idle CPU overhead.
